      "content": "A \"limited stock\" countdown timer is generally more effective for driving immediate action than simply hiking the price. Scarcity plays on urgency, encouraging impulse buys before the perceived opportunity vanishes. Price increases based solely on low supply can often trigger backlash if not framed carefully. I recommend the countdown timer to create dynamic fear of missing out (FOMO) while keeping the base price attractive.",
